      "text_id": "H32-gua_ci",
      "text_type": "gua_ci",
      "line_position": null,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "恒：亨，无咎，利贞。利有攸往。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H32-tuan",
      "text_type": "tuan",
      "line_position": null,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "恒，久也。刚上而柔下，雷风相与，巽而动，刚柔皆应，恒。恒亨，无咎，利贞，久于其道也。天地之道，恒久而不已也。利有攸往，终则有始也。日月得天而能久照，四时变化而能久成，圣人久于其道而天下化成。观其所恒，而天地万物之情可见矣！",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H32-da_xiang",
      "text_type": "da_xiang",
      "line_position": null,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "雷风，恒。君子以立不易方。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H32-yao_ci-L1",
      "text_type": "yao_ci",
      "line_position": 1,
      "line_name": "初六",
      "candidate_text": "浚恒，贞凶，无攸利。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H32-yao_ci-L2",
      "text_type": "yao_ci",
      "line_position": 2,
      "line_name": "九二",
      "candidate_text": "悔亡。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H32-yao_ci-L3",
      "text_type": "yao_ci",
      "line_position": 3,
      "line_name": "九三",
      "candidate_text": "不恒其德，或承之羞，贞吝。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H32-yao_ci-L4",
      "text_type": "yao_ci",
      "line_position": 4,
      "line_name": "九四",
      "candidate_text": "田无禽。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H32-yao_ci-L5",
      "text_type": "yao_ci",
      "line_position": 5,
      "line_name": "六五",
      "candidate_text": "恒其德，贞，妇人吉，夫子凶。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H32-yao_ci-L6",
      "text_type": "yao_ci",
      "line_position": 6,
      "line_name": "上六",
      "candidate_text": "振恒，凶。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H32-xiao_xiang-L1",
      "text_type": "xiao_xiang",
      "line_position": 1,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "“浚恒”之凶，始求深也。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H32-xiao_xiang-L2",
      "text_type": "xiao_xiang",
      "line_position": 2,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "九二悔亡，能久中也。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H32-xiao_xiang-L3",
      "text_type": "xiao_xiang",
      "line_position": 3,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "“不恒其德”，无所容也。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H32-xiao_xiang-L4",
      "text_type": "xiao_xiang",
      "line_position": 4,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "久非其位，安得禽也？",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H32-xiao_xiang-L5",
      "text_type": "xiao_xiang",
      "line_position": 5,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "“妇人贞吉”，从一而终也；夫子制义，从妇凶也。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H32-xiao_xiang-L6",
      "text_type": "xiao_xiang",
      "line_position": 6,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "“振恒”在上，大无功也。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    }
  ]
